				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>すばらしい▼
君と　出会い
戦えたこと　感謝する▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-07T10:19:00" />
